    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d484">

                <pb facs="0565" n="469" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg469"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Buck to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Tokyo,
                                Japan</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1899-07-07"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 7, 1899</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 323.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith
                    newspaper clippings from the local papers, giving translations of several
                    rescripts and instructions issued by the Emperor and the ministers of state
                    respecting the operation of the new treaties, together with the comments of the
                    vernacular press in relation thereto.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. E. Buck.</hi></signed></closer>













